Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

I know, its kind of counterintuitive to me as well, but this is what
``they'' wanted.

you can chose another linkfunction that say that

\lambda = exp(-\eta)

that is the neglog link,

control.family = list(control.link = list(model = "neglog"))

try that, and let me know.

H

